      "message": "feat(browser): experience-driven fleet — Outcome River credit ring feeds idle grace + reliability-ordered retirement (T3-9)\n\n- rsi-outcome-river: bounded recent-credits ring (64 entries, ids+sign only)\n  appended at credit time, persisted durably, snapshot exposes last 32.\n- fleet-experience-signal (new): pure projection over the ring — recent\n  positive velocity (60min window, saturation 24) -> grace cycles (max +4);\n  per-agent/per-role success rates; all authority fences false.\n- fleet-elastic-governor: experience grace extends the idle shrink horizon;\n  retirement re-ranked by role reliability BEFORE the bound is applied\n  (worst first, unknown between bands via neutral 0.5 midpoint, proven-good\n  keeps its agents even when newest; stable sort keeps newest-first within\n  a band). Demand math, warm floor and scheduler authority unchanged.\n- devos cycle: derives the signal from state.rsi_outcome_river each\n  reconcile; missing signal keeps every pre-T3 behavior exact.\n- tests: 10 new (signal derivation, aggregation, saturation/clamps, grace\n  hold, bound-after-ranking regression, malformed-signal clamps, ring sign\n  + restart durability). Full suite 3290 pass / 0 fail / 2 skipped.",
